@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 124
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 275
title S04-ddd-policy-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "auth: AuthorizationApplicationService" as auth
participant "reads: AuthorizationReadTransaction" as reads
participant "repo: AuthorizationRepository" as repo
participant "policy: AuthorizationPolicy" as policy
activate obj
obj -> auth: 1. api(userId, system, operationId)
activate auth
alt outer read-only
auth -> reads: 2. fresh(query callback)
activate reads
note right of reads
REQUIRES_NEW, READ_COMMITTED, readOnly.
Clear the JPA context at the start of each attempt.
end note
reads -> auth: 3. stableApi(userId, system, operationId)
activate auth
ref over auth,policy: Run the stableApi retry loop shown below
auth -->> reads: allowed
deactivate auth
reads -->> auth: allowed
deactivate reads
||12||
else direct call
auth -> auth: 4. stableApi(userId, system, operationId)
activate auth
loop up to 3 tries
auth -> repo: 5. version()
activate repo
repo -->> auth: initial version
deactivate repo
auth -> repo: 6. operation(system, operationId)
activate repo
repo -->> auth: registered operation or null
deactivate repo
break missing
auth -->> obj: DomainException 404 API_OPERATION_NOT_FOUND
||12||
end
auth -> repo: 7. identity(userId)
activate repo
repo -->> auth: target identity
deactivate repo
note right of auth
allowed starts false.
end note
opt target active
auth -> auth: 8. effective(userId, system)
activate auth
auth -->> auth: effective permissions
deactivate auth
auth -> repo: 9. identity(userId)
activate repo
repo -->> auth: current target identity
deactivate repo
opt still active
auth -> policy: 10. allows(operation, effective)
activate policy
policy -->> auth: allowed
deactivate policy
||12||
end
end
auth -> repo: 11. version()
activate repo
repo -->> auth: final version
deactivate repo
note right of auth
Stop when the version matches.
Retry when the version changes.
end note
||12||
end
break unstable
auth -->> obj: DomainException 503 AUTHORIZATION_UNSTABLE
||12||
end
deactivate auth
||12||
end
auth -->> obj: allowed
deactivate auth
deactivate obj
@enduml